-- 1 · THE ESTATE LIFECYCLE RECORD — one authoritative current state per estate
-- ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
--
-- ★ ABSENT ROW = 'active'. Every estate that has never seen a death-verification case has no row
